{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"tv/1097","tmdb_id":1097,"title":"死亡代理人","original_title":"エルゴプラクシー","overview":"这个世界构建在人与机器共同生活的基础之上。在这个世界里，感情是不被允许且也不需要的事，这个科技无限发达，人情无限冷漠的都市被称之为“Romdo”。每个乐园的人都有一台属于自己的机器人，被称之为“Autoreiv”，用来检测人的感情波动；而人类也在提防Autoreiv，避免他们感染上名为“Cogito”的自我意识。  这种相互制约的关系被发生在Romdo的一系列杀人事件所打破。调查此事的市民情报局的Rilu（齐藤梨绘 配音）发现这些杀人事件比想象中复杂和黑暗的多，随着调查的深入，Rilu的人身安全开始受到威胁，许多怪物、机械相继登场，一切都在阻止着她的调查。到底Romdo的背后暗藏着什么真相，让我们随着Rilu来一一揭晓。","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rObNchuE0AHF6KSsA5bVxpj2Lre.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGAgj9QztYjSsYCnZhDMgBUzQKU.jpg","first_air_date":"2006-02-25","last_air_date":"2006-08-12","year":"2006","episode_run_time":"25 minutes","number_of_episodes":23,"number_of_seasons":1,"tmdb_rating_average":7.675,"tmdb_votes":408,"tmdb_rating":"7.675 / 10 from 408 users","genres":["动画","悬疑","Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"languages":["Japanese"],"countries":["Japan"],"production_companies":["Manglobe","Geneon Entertainment","WOWOW FILMS"],"directors":[],"producers":[{"name":"河内山隆","id":2065290},{"name":"松田章男","id":1126290}],"cast":[{"id":1222156,"name":"齐藤梨绘","original_name":"斉藤梨絵","character":"Re-l Mayer (voice)","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/2xtvi8q3hEZqJekW9lM9MJ6Yhqf.jpg"},{"id":555099,"name":"游佐浩二","original_name":"遊佐浩二","character":"Vincent Law (voice)","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/vBo8dHvZvbG4kax0LcaWvrXUZuX.jpg"},{"id":90499,"name":"矢岛晶子","original_name":"矢島晶子","character":"Pino (voice)","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/7b9jO2IYcSpBQRcmhXnlOIgwmRI.jpg"}],"imdb_id":"tt0791205","imdb_link":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0791205/"}